  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TeJCIjl.png\" alt=\"Formations Nether 橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Nether</strong>&nbsp;在地獄新增了許多新的建築結構！</h3><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5g5Tv1t.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>建築結構</strong></h4><h5>以下是在 Formations Nether 中能找到的一些建築範例。更多圖片請參閱圖片庫。</h5><div>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/728/310/172/small_fire_arena.png\" alt=\"充滿凋零敵人的致命競技場\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/729/310/172/nether_wart_field.png\" alt=\"地獄疙瘩田\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/739/310/172/blackstone_remnant.png\" alt=\"黑石結構的遺跡\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/731/310/172/large_house.png\" alt=\"隱藏在緋紅森林中的房屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eBJO3ce.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>常見問題</strong></h4><h5><strong>我可以在我的模組包中使用你的模組嗎？</strong></h5><h5>是的，歡迎在我的模組包中使用這個模組</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PXuubVS.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4><h5>想了解更多未來內容、即將推出的模組及討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord 加入按鈕\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PaZVj5S.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/L7py1j1.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DAvtJUL.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
